8 space-y-10\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-gold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-body mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Origins\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-4xl text-ink mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Born into Humble Beginnings,\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"br\\\",null,{}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-blush italic\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"with a Gift\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4 text-ink/65 font-body leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"I was born into very humble beginnings with my gift and insights. At age 8 or 9, my grandmother who raised me bought a set of paints and brushes — she was tired of me painting every possible space under our elevated home on concrete blocks. From the onset of this simple and not so obvious present, my journey as an artist began without the aid of any formal training.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"I always determined to myself to be an artist of note. My grandmother and childhood friends saw in me something special, even when I doubted my path.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"With all of the distractions of growing into adulthood, I never relinquished my desire to create scenes from my immediate green lushness and very colorful surroundings. I was and still am an avid devotee of sunsets and unusual land formations.\\\"}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"w-full h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-gold/20 via-gold/10 to-transparent\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-gold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-body mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Journey\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-4xl text-ink mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"From the Atlantic Coast\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"br\\\",null,{}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-celestial italic\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"to Santa Barbara\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4 text-ink/65 font-body leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"My early career was identified with landscapes and seascapes. I was born on the Atlantic coast of South America in a small country called Guyana — land of waters. By my late 20s I migrated to the United States to pursue an undergraduate degree in Communication and the Arts, which I completed successfully.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"I then moved to graduate school at the University of California at Santa Barbara, where I completed my Master of Fine Arts. It was during this foray that my artwork took what some called a dramatic detour into the world of magical realism — a juxtaposition of what we commonly call the real world alongside the world of an otherworldly consciousness.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"I identified with the freedom to express myself in ways that were not governed by the conventions of classical and contemporary western art parlance and expression.\\\"}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"w-full h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-gold/20 via-gold/10 to-transparent\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-gold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-body mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Philosophy\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-4xl text-ink mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Symbolic Logic \\u0026\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"br\\\",null,{}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-ember italic\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Dream Consciousness\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4 text-ink/65 font-body leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The creation of symbolic logic took center stage as I reflected on objects I was familiar with but turned them into symbols of how I viewed the world — in a word, my consciousness. Sky and water were no longer separate entities; they became fluid and interchangeable for me. Land formations and atmospheric conditions were assigned to different locations in the world I created from my imagination.\\\"}],\\\"$L17\\\",\\\"$L18\\\"]}]]}],\\\"$L19\\\",\\\"$L1a\\\",\\\"$L1b\\\"]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"10:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"footer\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"relative border-t border-whisper bg-vellum\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-96 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-gold/30 to-transparent\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-16\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 mb-12\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-3xl text-ink mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Clinton Crawford\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-dusk/50 tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Professor Emeritus · MFA · Artist\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-dusk/70 font-body leading-relaxed max-w-xs\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Born in Guyana, South America. Works in magical realism exploring portals between real and imagined worlds.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h4\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-xl text-gold mb-4 tracking-wide\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Explore\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"ul\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[